Now I get ready for the office.
I put on my clothes.
Now I pack my bag.
Where is my laptop?
The laptop is on the table.
I put the laptop in the bag.
Now I take the lunchbox.
I put the lunchbox in the bag too.
My water bottle is here.
I place the water bottle inside.
Now I check everything.
Is everything in the bag?
The laptop is inside.
The lunchbox is also inside.
Where is my mobile?
The mobile is on the bed.
I take the mobile.
I take the house key.
Now I am fully ready.
I go to the bus stop.
